==============================================================================
MODIFICATION NOTICE
==============================================================================

This fork is maintained by Antiona and was modified in November 2026. The
following changes were made to the upstream work:

1. Replaced the pink/sakura theme accents with a blue palette in both light and
   dark modes, including design tokens, gradients, shadows, comment widgets,
   TOC petals, the 404 illustration, the petal particle colors, the footer
   spinner and the default friend-card avatar.
2. Replaced the upstream wordmark and favicon with new "Antiona" brand assets:
   src/assets/svg/logo.svg, public/favicon.svg, public/favicon.ico,
   public/apple-touch-icon.png, public/favicon-192.png and public/favicon-512.png.
3. Added a tab-away title behavior in src/lib/tab-title.ts, wired from
   src/layouts/AppShell.astro.
4. Removed all upstream sample blog posts from src/content/blog/ and removed
   the sample featured categories, sample weekly series and weekly navigation
   entry from config/site.yaml.
5. Rewrote README.md and added this NOTICE file. package.json now declares
   "license": "AGPL-3.0-only".
6. Custom changes are marked in source comments with the tags [蓝调主题],
   [品牌资产], [标签页提示], [示例清理] and [开源合规].

The upstream files that were not modified remain under their original
copyright and license notices.

